Forsaken, <u><i><b>but that core needed more errata than the original Geist printing</b></i></u>, IMO.</div> </div> </div> </div>BIU for emphasis. Wow, that is, that is a terrifying concept. I mean. Wow. Cause Geist was pretty bad off... If that's even close to an accurate statement, then I'm kinda glad that the Forsaken core isn't available POD, because I'd probably be rather upset if I'd gotten it.<br /> <br /> Either way, given the extent of the update chronicles, I'm waiting (impatiently) for the Idigim Chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T22:06:41-08:00","id":30270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/8409-forsaken-main-book?p=30191#post30191\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love me some Forsaken, but that core needed more errata than the original Geist printing, IMO.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm. I wouldn't go THAT far. But, it still did need some cleaning up, I would agree with that.<br /> <br /> As far as not having a PoD option? It's one of those things that's been bothering me for quite some time. I guess being a Platinum bestseller just isn't good enough to be given a PoD feature. How sad. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/427-rahuman101","name":"Rahuman101","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar427_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-15T07:16:33-08:00","id":30406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TiwazTyrsfist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/8409-forsaken-main-book?p=30200#post30200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> BIU for emphasis. Wow, that is, that is a terrifying concept. I mean. Wow. Cause Geist was pretty bad off... If that's even close to an accurate statement, then I'm kinda glad that the Forsaken core isn't available POD, because I'd probably be rather upset if I'd gotten it.<br /> <br /> Either way, given the extent of the update chronicles, I'm waiting (impatiently) for the Idigim Chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not, relax.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T12:04:04-08:00","id":31819,"title":"","content":"I'm guilty of some hyperbole there, but if it were up to me there would have been things printed in later supplements that I would have included in the core rulebook. The Pure would have been the first thing I would have included, instead of covering them in a standalone book with a small print run. Death Grip is unusable as printed and needed to be errata'd, some Spirit Numina needed clarification (Blast comes to mind), I probably wouldn't have mentioned the Maeljin until the idea was better fleshed out, to me they still feel like an unfinished concept in Forsaken. Lore of the Forsaken covered a lot of what I felt was missing and would recommend that it be purchased along with the core rules, Blood of the Wolf as well. Those two supplements both feel like they were filled with info that was cut from the main book due to wordcount. I'm hoping to see IC do a better job of organizing info and keeping it concise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://f